  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/budimanjojo/talhelper/tarball/v3.1.17",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/budimanjojo/talhelper/zipball/v3.1.17",
  "body": "This will be the last release of Talhelper.\nIt's been an awesome four years journey for me, unfortunately I no longer have the time and motivation to continue with the development.\n\nA lot of people have contributed to this tool, which is a big surprise for me considering this is my first ever tool that isn't shell script.\nFor those who have contributed, whether you're simply using this tool as an user, or just reported an issue, to code and financial contributor, I want to say THANK YOU!\n\nThis repo will now be archived, and I suggest people who depend on this tool to migrate to other similar tool like [topf](https://github.com/postfinance/topf) and [talstomize](https://github.com/mirceanton/talstomize).\n",
